        81.83369445800781
      ],
      "text": "(CIs) were calculated using the score method. Covariate selection for calculation of propensity scores",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.999199867248535,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        80.59070587158203,
        527.3773803710938,
        95.03370666503906
      ],
      "text": "was based on data availability and clinical knowledge. The covariates considered for inclusion in the",
