      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        120.19074249267578,
        527.2682495117188,
        134.6337432861328
      ],
      "text": "index (BMI), smoking status, diabetes diagnosis, cavitation at baseline, presence of bilateral disease and",
