      "size": 10.954355239868164,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        133.3907012939453,
        527.402587890625,
        147.8336944580078
      ],
      "text": "fluroquinolone resistance. For the calculation of aRRs, multiple imputation by chain equations using",
