      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        253.1024932861328,
        527.4122924804688,
        267.5455017089844
      ],
      "text": "combined multiple cohorts with variable follow-up times). Follow-up time was separated into the time",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.973618507385254,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        266.302490234375,
        527.4398803710938,
        280.7455139160156
      ],
      "text": "between commencement of treatment and treatment completion, and the period from treatment",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        279.50262451171875,
        527.133056640625,
        293.9456481933594
      ],
      "text": "completion until the end of follow-up. For shorter regimens, post-treatment follow-up was particularly",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.969407081604004,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        292.70257568359375,
        527.4431762695312,
        307.1455993652344
      ],
      "text": "important because higher relapse rates may be a consequence of shorter treatments that do not",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        304.6265869140625,
        527.2304077148438,
        320.3456115722656
      ],
      "text": "M. tuberculosis completely remove  . Where possible, it was important for follow-up time between two",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 10.989094734191895,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        319.10260009765625,
        527.0821533203125,
        333.5456237792969
      ],
      "text": "groups in a comparison to be equivalent, so that participants had an equivalent likelihood of death or",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.982385635375977,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        332.3025207519531,
        527.4266967773438,
        346.74554443359375
      ],
      "text": "relapse. In these analyses, the follow-up time was measured from the start date of treatment rather",
