      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        345.5025939941406,
        527.4003295898438,
        359.94561767578125
      ],
      "text": "than after the date of treatment completion, to minimize the effect of differences in total follow-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        358.7025146484375,
        93.42709350585938,
        373.1455383300781
      ],
      "text": "time.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        380.406494140625,
        413.474365234375,
        394.8495178222656
      ],
      "text": "The principles for accounting for time periods of follow-up were as follows:",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        402.11041259765625,
        78.23609924316406,
        416.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        402.11041259765625,
        527.4400634765625,
        416.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "Where possible, follow up participants in the intervention and control groups for the same total",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        415.3103942871094,
        507.3583679199219,
        429.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "time, so that the likelihood of unsuccessful outcomes (e.g. death) is the same in both groups.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        428.5104064941406,
        78.23609924316406,
        442.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        428.5104064941406,
        527.398193359375,
        442.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "Limit follow-up to 24 months after treatment initiation for all cohorts. There were no analyses in",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        441.7104187011719,
        527.5616455078125,
        456.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "which both intervention and comparator cohorts had more than 24 months of follow-up available.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98378849029541,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        454.910400390625,
        527.2188720703125,
        469.3534240722656
      ],
      "text": "The evidence accumulated from TB treatment trials demonstrates that a high proportion of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        466.83441162109375,
        476.7703857421875,
        482.5534362792969
      ],
      "text": "(33) recurrences are likely to occur within 12 or even 6 months of stopping treatment  .",
      "font": "SegoeUI-LightItalic",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        481.3103942871094,
        78.23609924316406,
        495.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "•",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        78.23609924316406,
        481.3103942871094,
        527.4368286132812,
        495.75341796875
      ],
      "text": "Select a primary analysis that optimizes the number of participants included in both groups. For",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        494.5104064941406,
        527.5986938476562,
        508.95343017578125
      ],
      "text": "shorter (6–9-month regimens), follow-up time in the comparison was included to allow for relapse",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.990796089172363,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        82.86609649658203,
        507.71044921875,
        153.24188232421875,
        522.1534423828125
      ],
      "text": "to be captured.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        529.4144287109375,
        527.5763549804688,
        543.857421875
      ],
      "text": "Additional sensitivity analyses were performed, where possible, evaluating the effect of follow-up",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        542.6143798828125,
        216.4928741455078,
        557.057373046875
      ],
      "text": "time upon treatment outcomes.",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        570.4315795898438,
        493.0606994628906,
        586.2836303710938
      ],
      "text": "Summary of evidence on desirable and undesirable effects and certainty of",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        585.4315795898438,
        119.38089752197266,
        601.2836303710938
      ],
      "text": "evidence",
      "font": "SegoeUI-BoldItalic",
      "size": 12.0,
      "type": "heading"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        608.4915161132812,
        527.546142578125,
        622.9345092773438
      ],
      "text": "The evidence on the novel regimens to inform PICO questions was derived from two trials. It included",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.98373794555664,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        621.6915283203125,
        527.5287475585938,
        636.134521484375
      ],
      "text": "information on a total of 419 of 423 participants who were enrolled in four arms of the TB-PRACTECAL",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 10.963088035583496,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        634.8914794921875,
        448.85650634765625,
        649.33447265625
      ],
      "text": "and on 172 of 181 participants who were enrolled in four arms of the ZeNix trial .  26",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        656.5955200195312,
        527.3837890625,
        671.0385131835938
      ],
      "text": "Data from patients in relevant arms of these trials were used in each of the comparisons that led to",
      "font": "SegoeUI-Light",
      "size": 11.0,
      "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
      "bbox": [
        70.86609649658203,
        669.7955322265625,
        527.446533203125,
        684.238525390625
      ],
      "text": "the conclusions and final recommendation on the use of the BPaLM/BPaL regimen. Even though the",
